<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_持续进行、坚持不懈与岁月流逝 (Continuation, Persistence & Progression — '一直往前')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 106 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 1/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>发生</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>happen, hap</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> come to pass<div class='ex-sent'>“What is happening?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 2/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>继续下去，发生，进行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>continue, proceed</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> continue talking;  he continued,<div class='ex-sent'>“I know it's hard,”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 3/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>发生，进行，上</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>advance, progress</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move forward, also in the metaphorical sense<div class='ex-sent'>“Time marches on”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>影响</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>exert</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> to exert effort in order to do, make, or perform something<div class='ex-sent'>“the child worked at the multiplication table until she had it down cold”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>be <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>晾，使通风，夸耀</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>air, appear</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> appear in a show, on T.V. or radio<div class='ex-sent'>“The news won't be on tonight”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 1/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>出场，快来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>surface, appear</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> appear or become visible; make a showing<div class='ex-sent'>“She turned up at the funeral”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 1/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>融洽相处</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>relate, smooth</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> have smooth relations<div class='ex-sent'>“My boss and I get along very well”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 2/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>进展，穿上，上去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>progress, advance</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> develop in a positive way<div class='ex-sent'>“He progressed well in school”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 3/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>进展</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>air, appear</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> appear in a show, on T.V. or radio<div class='ex-sent'>“The news won't be on tonight”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 4/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>上去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>approach, grow</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> grow late or (of time) elapse<div class='ex-sent'>“It is getting on midnight--let's all go to bed!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 5/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>穿上，上去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>mount, bestride</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> get up on the back of<div class='ex-sent'>“mount a horse”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 6/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>进展，使前进</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>board, enter</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> get on board of (trains, buses, ships, aircraft, etc.)<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to get on (get on board of (trains, buses, ships, aircraft, etc.)).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>继续工作</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>process, transform</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> shape, form, or improve a material<div class='ex-sent'>“work stone into tools”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>it on</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>爱，爱好，爱慕</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>love, know</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> have sexual intercourse with<div class='ex-sent'>“This student sleeps with everyone in her dorm”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 7/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>开始衰老，变老，成熟</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>senesce, age</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> grow old or older<div class='ex-sent'>“She aged gracefully”</div></td></tr>
