<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_穿戴、开启设备、承担与雇佣增重 (Wearing, Activation & Undertaking — '附着/开启')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 35 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 1/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>呈现，雇用，接纳</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>assume, acquire</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take on a certain form, attribute, or aspect<div class='ex-sent'>“His voice took on a sad tone”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 2/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>接纳，承担，同...较量</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>undertake, tackle</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> accept as a challenge<div class='ex-sent'>“I'll tackle this difficult task”</div></td></tr>
