<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03_依赖、指望、取决于与建立在 (Dependence, Reliance & Basis — '倚靠在...上')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 15 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rest <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>停留在，信赖</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>touch, adjoin</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> rest on for support<div class='ex-sent'>“you can lean on me if you get tired”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rest <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>骑，乘坐，压迫</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>ride, based</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be based on; of theories and claims, for example<div class='ex-sent'>“What's this new evidence based on?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>act <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>按...行动，作用于</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>pursue, react</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> carry further or advance<div class='ex-sent'>“Can you act on this matter soon?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>act <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>按...行动，作用于</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>act, regulate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> regulate one's behavior in accordance with certain information, ideas, or advice<div class='ex-sent'>“The Founding Fathers acted on certain moral principles”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>depend <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>骑，乘坐，压迫</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>ride</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be contingent on<div class='ex-sent'>“The outcomes rides on the results of the election”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>build <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>以…为基础</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>ride, based</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be based on; of theories and claims, for example<div class='ex-sent'>“What's this new evidence based on?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>bet <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>打赌</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>back, gage</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> place a bet on<div class='ex-sent'>“Which horse are you backing?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>count <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>计算，预测，计划</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>calculate, estimate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> judge to be probable<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to count on (judge to be probable).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>feed <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>以...为食，以...为能源</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>meet, satisfy</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be sustained by<div class='ex-sent'>“He fed on the great ideas of her mentor”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>lean <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>接触，触摸，触及</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>touch, adjoin</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> rest on for support<div class='ex-sent'>“you can lean on me if you get tired”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rely <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>依赖，依靠</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>support</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be dependent on, as for support or maintenance<div class='ex-sent'>“elderly parents often depend on their adult children”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rely <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>依赖</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>trust</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put trust in with confidence<div class='ex-sent'>“she is someone you can really rely on when times get rough”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>depend <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>依靠，依赖</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>support</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be dependent on, as for support or maintenance<div class='ex-sent'>“elderly parents often depend on their adult children”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>depend <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>依赖</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>trust</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put trust in with confidence<div class='ex-sent'>“she is someone you can really rely on when times get rough”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>hinge <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>靠...转动，以...为转移</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>ride</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be contingent on<div class='ex-sent'>“The outcomes rides on the results of the election”</div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04_袭击、欺凌、告密、突然顿悟与传染 (Attack, Betrayal, Dawning & Influence — '加诸于某人')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 22 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>呼吁，约请</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>appeal, invoke</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> have recourse to or make an appeal or request for help or information to<div class='ex-sent'>“She called on her Representative to help her”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>look <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>观看，看待</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>watch, observe</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> observe with attention<div class='ex-sent'>“They watched as the murderer was executed”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>look <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>认为，以为，尊敬</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repute, esteem</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> look on as or consider<div class='ex-sent'>“she looked on this affair as a joke”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>on fire</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使燃烧，使情绪激动，放火</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>burn, combust</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> set fire to; cause to start burning<div class='ex-sent'>“Lightening set fire to the forest”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>tell <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>告发，产生影响</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>affect, impact</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> produce an effect or strain on somebody<div class='ex-sent'>“Each step told on his tired legs”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>tell <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>告发</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>denounce, betray</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> give away information about somebody<div class='ex-sent'>“He told on his classmate who had cheated on the exam”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>攻击</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>assail, assault</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> attack someone physically or emotionally<div class='ex-sent'>“The mugger assaulted the woman”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>wait <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>服侍，招待，焦急地等待</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>serve, attend</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> work for or be a servant to<div class='ex-sent'>“May I serve you?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 1/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>交给，支持，搀扶</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hand, reach</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> place into the hands or custody of<div class='ex-sent'>“hand me the spoon, please”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>lead <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>劝诱，哄骗</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>entice, lure</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> entice or induce especially when unwise or mistaken<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to lead on (entice or induce especially when unwise or mistaken).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 2/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>传授，传递</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>impart, leave</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> transmit (knowledge or skills)<div class='ex-sent'>“give a secret to the Russians”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>lead <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>哄骗</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>deceive, delude</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be false to; be dishonest with<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to lead on (be false to).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 3/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>前进，进展，提高</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>advance, progress</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move forward, also in the metaphorical sense<div class='ex-sent'>“Time marches on”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 4/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>传授，传递</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>bequeath, will</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> give to or transfer possession of<div class='ex-sent'>“She passed the family jewels on to her daughter-in-law”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>catch <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>变得流行，理解</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>tumble, twig</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> understand, usually after some initial difficulty<div class='ex-sent'>“She didn't know what her classmates were plotting but finally caught on”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 5/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>传授，传递</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>communicate, convey</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> transmit information<div class='ex-sent'>“Please communicate this message to all employees”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 6/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>传授，传递</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>circulate, distribute</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause be distributed<div class='ex-sent'>“This letter is being circulated among the faculty”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 7/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>驱逐，使降低地位，把...归类</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>relegate, submit</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> refer to another person for decision or judgment<div class='ex-sent'>“She likes to relegate difficult questions to her colleagues”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>catch <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>变得流行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>change, become</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> become popular<div class='ex-sent'>“This fashion caught on in Paris”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>egg <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>鼓动</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>prod, incite</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> urge on; cause to act<div class='ex-sent'>“The other children egged the boy on, but he did not want to throw the stone through the window”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>urge <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>催促…向前，驱赶…向前</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>urge, press</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> force or impel in an indicated direction<div class='ex-sent'>“I urged him to finish his studies”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>urge <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>催促…向前，驱赶…向前</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cheer, inspire</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> spur on or encourage especially by cheers and shouts<div class='ex-sent'>“The crowd cheered the demonstrating strikers”</div></td></tr>
</table></details>
